{#
_progress.html.twig — the numbered rail across the top of the wizard.

Built from the steps this user actually gets, not from the enum: a plain user
must never see a pill for an admin step they will never be offered, and the
"3 of 4" in the header has to agree with what is on screen.

Every pill navigates. Setup is not a funnel — going back to change the address
you just typed should not mean clicking Back four times — and a step already
answered is worth being able to revisit.

They submit the step rather than linking away from it, for the same reason the
provider chips do: a link discards whatever was entered and not yet saved, so
ticking a box and then clicking the next pill lost the tick.

Three states, and "done" is not the same as "behind you": a step is marked
complete when it has actually been answered, so skipping one leaves it plainly
unfinished rather than quietly ticked.

A fourth, and the important one: a step that was filled in but does not work —
a mistyped app password, a server refusing the connection — gets a cross rather
than a tick. Ticking it would be worse than showing nothing, because the user
would stop looking.

Scrolls horizontally rather than wrapping. Six pills do not fit on a phone, and
a rail that reflows to two rows moves the body down mid-wizard.
#}
<div class="px-6 pb-4 shrink-0 overflow-x-auto" data-controller="onboarding--form-nav">
    <input type="hidden" name="goto_step" value="" data-onboarding--form-nav-target="field">

    <ol class="flex items-center gap-1.5 min-w-max">
        {% for item in steps %}
            {% set isCurrent = item.value == current.value %}
            {% set status = statuses[item.value]|default({ done: false, error: null }) %}
            {% set isDone = status.done %}
            {% set isFailing = status.error is not null %}

            <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <button
                    type="button"
                    id="onboarding-pill-{{ item.value }}"
                    data-value="{{ item.value }}"
                    data-action="click->onboarding--form-nav#go"
                    class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 h-7 pl-2 pr-2.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium
                           border transition-colors
                           {% if isCurrent %}
                             border-accent bg-accent/10 text-accent
                           {% elseif isFailing %}
                             pill-failed
                           {% elseif isDone %}
                             pill-done
                           {% else %}
                             border-line text-ink-faint hover:bg-hover cursor-pointer
                           {% endif %}"
                    {% if isCurrent %}aria-current="step"{% endif %}
                    {% if isFailing %}title="{{ status.error }}"{% endif %}
                >
                    <i class="{{ isDone and not isCurrent ? 'fa-solid fa-check' : item.icon }} text-[11px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    {{ (item.transKey ~ '.title')|trans }}
                </button>

                {% if not loop.last %}
                    <span class="w-4 h-px bg-line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                {% endif %}
            </li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ol>
</div>
